WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:0% align:end size:15%
<ruby><rt>kaa.lt</rt></ruby>

1
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.920
EPISODE 4: THE ONE WHO STOLE THE FUTURE

2
00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:46.090
I can't believe those soldiers.
Putting you on the front line like that...

3
00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:50.590
How do you know about that?

4
00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.110
Oh, I just do.

5
00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:56.680
Well, you're right!
They even monitor me all the time!

6
00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:58.790
We can go now.

7
00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:08.230
Okay. Let's make a little 
trouble for those jerks.

8
00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:17.170
What the heck? He isn't scary at all.

9
00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.990
Someone like him would 
never curse me to death.

10
00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:24.620
Plus, now that our eyes have met,
I can read his future.

11
00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:28.000
Oh, wait... I left the 
Future Guide at home.

12
00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:34.810
COFFEE

13
00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.390
Wh-What is this?

14
00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.960
What are you doing?

15
00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:53.900
Shh. Keep quiet.
And give me your phone.

16
00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:58.500
Did you think I don't know who you are?

17
00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:02.840
The Future Guide belongs to you, right?

18
00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:07.040
Oh, no! He knows who I am!

19
00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.230
Please enjoy.

20
00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:17.880
Shall we start our date, then?

21
00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:25.770
Take out the Future Guide, and copy 
all the prophecies you see into this.

22
00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.870
What kind of date is this?!

23
00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.020
And the Future Guide is at my house.

24
00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:31.790
Are you joking?

25
00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:35.030
Touch the tattoo on your arm
and say, "Future Guide."

26
00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:38.100
That's how you summon it.

27
00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:40.550
You don't even know the basics?

28
00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:45.970
F-Future Guide...

29
00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.290
It really appeared!

30
00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:58.050
Write all of it.
Make sure you don't miss anything.

31
00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:16.110
You're slowing down.
You'll never finish that way.

32
00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:18.690
My arm hurts. I can't write any more.

33
00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.420
If you want the Future Guide, it's yours!

34
00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.530
So can't you just let me go?

35
00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.470
No.

36
00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:29.260
Why did I let him fool me 
just because he's hot?!

37
00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:32.820
If I could take it, 
I would've done that by now.

38
00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:36.510
But the Future Guide is a 
Legendary-grade relic at Grade S.

39
00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:39.800
PANDORA'S RELIC RANKING
GRADE SS (GOD-GRADE)
GRADE S (LEGENDARY-GRADE) - FUTURE GUIDE
GRADE A (EPIC-GRADE) - MURAMASA
GRADE B (RARE-GRADE) - GOLD/SILVER AXE
GRADE C (NORMAL-GRADE) - EGYPTIAN FUNERAL KNIFE
GRADE D (ANTIQUE-GRADE)

40
00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:40.440
The penalty for trying to force it 
under my control would be massive.

41
00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.470
Unlike with Muramasa, 
which is a lower grade,

42
00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.310
it wouldn't stop at just one arm.

43
00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.920
Please, sir, you can't...

44
00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.310
This is official business.

45
00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.390
Just cooperate. It won't take long.

46
00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.320
Those idiots found us.

47
00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:00.460
That's enough.

48
00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.570
P-Please don't.

49
00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:06.330
I think I'd be more useful to you alive...

50
00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:10.080
You're misunderstanding.

51
00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:27.300
Damned human!
What do you think you're doing?!

52
00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:43.590
I did that for you.

53
00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.620
[CRUEL RELIC DESTROYER]
YOU ACQUIRED A NEW TITLE.
YOUR DOMINANCE HAS INCREASED.
YOUR AFFINITY HAS DECREASED.

54
00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.870
YOUR ABILITY TO DETECT RELICS HAS IMPROVED.
THE SKILL "SPY" HAS REACHED RANK E.

55
00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:52.160
YOU DESTROYED A HIGH-GRADE RELIC
AND DISCOVERED THE HIDDEN SKILL "GIANT HUNTER."

56
00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.160
"Giant Hunter"?

57
00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:57.370
Freeze!

58
00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:58.750
Don't move!

59
00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:12.310
No! Th-The Future Guide!
What's going on here?!

60
00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.810
Exactly what it looks like.

61
00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.390
Exactly what it...

62
00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:21.360
What's your problem?! 
I'll have you executed here and now!

63
00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:24.540
Don't make me laugh.

64
00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:26.660
Wh-What?

65
00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:28.000
Have a bite of this instead.

66
00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:32.200
HOUSEWIFE'S DELICIOUS RICE CAKE
(GRADE C - NORMAL / CONSUMABLE RELIC)
INSTANT FOOD (SINGLE USE)

67
00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.590
I think you'll love it.

68
00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.560
What is this guy plotting?

69
00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:41.640
Huh? Where did he go?

70
00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:42.760
What's that smell?

71
00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.430
It smells so good...

72
00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.530
That's mine!

73
00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:02.740
You morons!

74
00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:06.280
Did you forget who's in 
command here?! This is mine!

75
00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.830
We've got guns, too!

76
00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:14.460
You bastards!

77
00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.710
Hand over the rice cake...

78
00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:18.710
The rice cake is mine!

79
00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:22.520
I said it's mine, you jackass!

80
00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.990
G-Gentlemen, please...

81
00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:25.860
Uh, what do we do about this?

82
00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:43.900
Found it.

83
00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.190
The Great Tombification.

84
00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:49.570
Back then, the entire world
was swallowed by a colossal tomb.

85
00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:53.840
It also caused far more relics
to start circulating.

86
00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:58.480
"In January, the time will be ripe 
in the underground garden of greed."

87
00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:06.270
"The great catastrophe that plunges 
the world into chaos will begin."

88
00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:12.700
"There, the god who knows the 
depths of your greed will join you."

89
00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:17.500
That must refer to the secret
Midas auction house in Las Vegas.

90
00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:21.860
And he's sure to be 
among the participants.

91
00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:34.410
We found three participants
with the initials "J.K."

92
00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.410
That's good intel.

93
00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.980
Is one of them the one you're looking for?

94
00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:40.420
Oh, yes.

95
00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:43.420
This is definitely Ogawara Taisei.

96
00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:48.420
NATIONALITY: PROBABLY JAPANESE
HEIGHT: 185 CM
WEIGHT: 80 KG
AGE: PROBABLY 50-60

97
00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:48.420
If he's here, some good relics
must be up for auction.

98
00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:58.120
None of them are God-grade, though.

99
00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:00.000
Then what was the prophecy referring to?

100
00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:03.940
Hammurabi's Code, Shakespeare's Pen...

101
00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.640
There are still a few things 
worth bidding on.

102
00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.570
What? You're gonna bid?

103
00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:15.580
You do know that bids in Midas 
auctions start at a billion, right?

104
00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.750
Of course. I don't have it 
on me now, though.

105
00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:19.780
Huh?

106
00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:24.920
Did you forget where we are?

107
00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:28.860
Let's make some quick cash.

108
00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:34.150
There's plenty of money to 
be won here in Las Vegas.

109
00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:38.080
The Future Guide was indeed destroyed.

110
00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:40.590
He shook off the soldiers 
who were there, too.

111
00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:44.520
And you say he did that all by himself?

112
00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:47.930
Yes. Should I find and eliminate him?

113
00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:53.570
No. Not if he's capable enough
to destroy the Future Guide.

114
00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:57.180
We'll bring him to our side.
I'm sure he'll be useful.

115
00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:58.180
Yes, sir.

116
00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.040
Damn, not again...

117
00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.320
Unbelievable!

118
00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:12.050
He's hitting the jackpot
on every machine!

119
00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:14.460
What trick is he using?

120
00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:21.480
Again?!

121
00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.310
Okay, on to the next machine.

122
00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:26.270
I'm so jealous...

123
00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.280
Teach me your secret! Please!

124
00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:31.290
Excuse me, sir. Do you mind if 
we conduct a brief inspection?

125
00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:34.840
No guest has ever hit this many 
jackpots in a row before.

126
00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:36.320
Go right ahead.

127
00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:42.540
What's this?

128
00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:48.280
Oh, this? Just a keychain 
I bought as a souvenir.

129
00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:51.550
What do you think? Lovely color, isn't it?

130
00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:54.060
It also works as a pocket knife.

131
00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.300
Pardon us.

132
00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.840
It's actually the Gold Axe. 
I just changed its shape.

133
00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:06.120
I used the Gold Axe's 
ability to attract wealth.

134
00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.640
This is so humiliating!

135
00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:12.560
Hey! How long do I have 
to stay in this for—

136
00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:16.230
I think I've been here long enough.

137
00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.860
Time to move elsewhere.

138
00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:23.540
Man, what a pain in the ass. 
It's too damn crowded.

139
00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:26.400
Everyone outta the way.

140
00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.460
Don't block the walkways.

141
00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:32.510
Don't you know a VIP is passing 
through? Talk about rude.

142
00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:35.700
Found him. I knew he'd be here.

143
00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:34.920
Absolutely disgraceful.

144
00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:41.050
He's younger than he was back then,
but still just as infuriating.

145
00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:44.960
If Ito Takuya is here, then...

146
00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:47.400
Out of the way.

147
00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.780
Ogawara Taisei.

148
00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:04.160
This way, sir.

149
00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:10.150
He doesn't know me yet.

150
00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.820
Just you wait, Ogawara.

151
00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:17.180
I'll be taking home all the 
best relics in this auction.

152
00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:18.050
Ryoga!

153
00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.190
Something's up with your bag.

154
00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.060
It's coming! It's coming!

155
00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:27.060
What's coming?

156
00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.460
It's coming! Oh, no!

157
00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:33.160
Unlike the Gold Axe,
which detects wealth for me,

158
00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:37.150
the Silver Axe warns its owner
of enemies targeting that wealth.

159
00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:38.400
What is it sensing?

160
00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.090
You bastard! You tricked me!

161
00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:43.530
As if! Hand over the money already!

162
00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.500
This is awful! How could 
all that money be stolen?

163
00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:50.960
Uh, the stock prices 
are suddenly tanking...

164
00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:52.640
Something's definitely up.

165
00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.710
Why is everyone freaking out?

166
00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:58.630
My smartphone doesn't work! 
It was fine just a minute ago!

167
00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.510
Why is this happening?

168
00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:02.800
Don't give me that bullshit!

169
00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.540
That woman... Don't tell me...

170
00:13:23.890 --> 00:13:28.180
Irene Holton, the youngest 
daughter of the Holton family.

171
00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:33.100
Before I was sent to the past, 
owners of God-grade relics

172
00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:37.970
were known as Kings of Fate,
Conquest, or Abundance.

173
00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:43.130
Among them, Irene Holton
possessed the most terrifying power.

174
00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:47.070
She was the Queen of Bankruptcy.

175
00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:50.480
She brought disaster upon 
everyone she came near.

176
00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:56.460
People lost their possessions or 
fell ill. Companies went bankrupt.

177
00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:58.940
I should stay away from her.

178
00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:02.150
Pack everything up.
We're getting out of here.

179
00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:02.940
What's going on?

180
00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:06.280
Excuse me!

181
00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.960
Please wait!

182
00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:17.500
AN OMINOUS PRESENCE
IS EMANATING FROM THE DOOR.

183
00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:18.710
THE RELICS IN YOUR POSSESSION
MAY TAKE MASSIVE DAMAGE.

184
00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.290
WARNING
NUMBER OF USES (DURABILITY) DECREASING!

185
00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:21.800
Oh, damn it!

186
00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:22.970
Excuse me!

187
00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:28.640
Would you please hear me out?

188
00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:33.470
AN OMINOUS RELIC'S PRESENCE 
HAS GRABBED YOU.

189
00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:34.930
YOUR RELICS HAVE TAKEN SIGNIFICANT DAMAGE
AND HAVE BEEN GREATLY WEAKENED.

190
00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.650
YOUR LUCK IS COMPLETELY OVERSHADOWED.
ANY FURTHER ATTEMPT WILL END IN FAILURE.

191
00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:37.650
Let go!

192
00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.640
Oh, I'm sorry.

193
00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:43.650
I was just so happy to see you...

194
00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:47.620
Hey, boss, what's up with Ryoga?

195
00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.410
How should I know?

196
00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.400
By any chance...

197
00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:57.840
Were you the person who just 
hit the jackpot a bunch of times?

198
00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.640
I've been looking for you.

199
00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:04.420
Please tell me your secret!

200
00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.930
I'm afraid you've got the wrong person.

201
00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.130
Dude, are you nuts?!

202
00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:13.890
A woman's approaching you, 
and you're just gonna turn her away?!

203
00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:18.300
Wait right here.
I'll smooth things over for you.

204
00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.940
I-I could tell you the trick.

205
00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:25.800
Hang on... uh... Wanna go grab dinner?

206
00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:28.240
You know any good places?

207
00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:28.240
What are you even doing?

208
00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.950
Oh, gosh! I'm sorry!

209
00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:33.440
Argh, my stomach...

210
00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.660
I'm so sorry!

211
00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.670
Please hear me out!

212
00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:43.670
It will only take ten, no,
five minutes! Please, just—

213
00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:52.060
Are you all right?

214
00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:55.320
Am I all right?

215
00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:58.560
Don't give me that shit!
This is all your fault!

216
00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.560
That's exactly what 
I wanted to talk about!

217
00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.150
What's that supposed to mean?

218
00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:08.040
Everyone around me is met with misfortune.

219
00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.070
I want to improve my luck

220
00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.830
so I can bring them good fortune.

221
00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:16.330
What the hell?

222
00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.410
She's the Queen of Bankruptcy.

223
00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.340
The one who ruined people 
and left the world in chaos.

224
00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:24.040
Is she putting on an act?

225
00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:29.200
Will you tell me the secret of your luck?

226
00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:32.010
I'll pay you as much as you want!

227
00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:35.430
This is not how I imagined her.

228
00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:38.760
YOU WERE ONCE AGAIN EXPOSED
TO THE FATAL PRESENCE OF A GOD-GRADE RELIC.
YOUR SKILL "TOLERANCE" HAS BEEN ACTIVATED.

229
00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.100
My Tolerance?

230
00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.190
YOUR TOLERANCE REDUCES
THE ENEMY RELIC'S EFFECT BY HALF.

231
00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:45.480
Isn't that the skill I got from that pill?

232
00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:44.810
???
(CONSUMABLE RELIC / GRADE ?)
INSTANT FOOD

233
00:16:46.570 --> 00:16:50.120
And it activated because of 
the Queen of Bankruptcy's attack?

234
00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:51.200
YOUR TOLERANCE REDUCES
THE ENEMY RELIC'S EFFECT BY HALF.

235
00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:53.280
So? What do you say?

236
00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:58.160
In that case, I don't need
to avoid this woman at all.

237
00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:02.980
Just having her nearby strengthens 
my Tolerance. This is perfect.

238
00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:08.210
On top of that, her presence will 
bring bad luck to the other bidders.

239
00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:10.580
An intriguing proposal.

240
00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:15.720
Unfortunately, I'm in a hurry.
I have an important appointment.

241
00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:18.970
Yes, I realize you're busy!

242
00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:22.230
So, while I would love to discuss
the details of our deal...

243
00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.990
I need to get to the auction hall.

244
00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:27.320
Oh, okay...

245
00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:30.820
Why don't you... accompany me?

246
00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:33.850
Of course! I'd be happy to!

247
00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:40.310
Someone... call an ambulance...

248
00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:46.340
Welcome, ladies and gentlemen.

249
00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:51.480
We will now begin the 74th auction.

250
00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:57.350
Thanks to Irene, two-thirds of 
the participants have already left.

251
00:17:57.350 --> 00:18:00.660
They must be dealing with
unexpected disasters.

252
00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:06.990
I heard Ogawara Taisei's factory in 
the Republic of Bent caught fire,

253
00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:08.820
but he didn't leave.

254
00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:13.150
He definitely wants something
that's up for sale today.

255
00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:16.830
Wow, a 100-year-old wine
from the Russian royal family!

256
00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:20.370
The items I'm interested
in will come later.

257
00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.370
Ah, I see.

258
00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:26.650
Irene Holton, Queen of Bankruptcy.

259
00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:29.260
She's so different from 
how I remember her.

260
00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:33.770
And she doesn't seem to know 
anything about relics.

261
00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:39.690
I guess that's possible, if the relic 
attached itself to her against her will.

262
00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:43.550
So the Queen of Bankruptcy
was once a kindhearted woman?

263
00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:47.930
I guess it was that relic
that ruined her life

264
00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.440
and gave her that nasty personality.

265
00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:56.530
I... wanted to thank you 
for accepting my proposal.

266
00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:01.200
Just telling someone about my worries 
has already helped me so much.

267
00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:04.210
Oh, it was no big deal.

268
00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.370
THE RELIC RESPONDS TO ITS OWNER'S MOOD.

269
00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.210
ITS POWER IS INCREASING EXPLOSIVELY.

270
00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.930
No, really! I'm truly happy!

271
00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:15.760
Shit! This is bad!

272
00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:17.010
A POWERFUL RELIC'S ENERGY 
SPREADS WITHIN A 1 KM RADIUS.

273
00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.760
A MASSIVE WAVE OF MISFORTUNE
BURIES EVERYTHING IN ITS PATH.

274
00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:20.760
THE RELICS IN YOUR POSSESSION
ARE TAKING HEAVY DAMAGE.

275
00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:24.420
I'm going to break!
Do something, you bastard!

276
00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:29.380
The misfortune gets stronger
the happier she is?

277
00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:31.900
What kind of psychopathic relic is this?!

278
00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:34.750
Irene-san, please calm down.

279
00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.030
We haven't even reached an agreement yet.

280
00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:43.540
I-I'm sorry. I've troubled you again.

281
00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:46.540
AS ITS OWNER'S MOOD CHANGES,
THE RELIC'S POWER DECREASES AGAIN.

282
00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:52.040
W-We were briefly interrupted by an 
earthquake, but it seems to have stopped.

283
00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.480
The bid currently stands
at 707,000 dollars.

284
00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:56.710
Does anyone bid more?

285
00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:57.740
One million!

286
00:19:57.740 --> 00:19:59.310
What the hell is this?!

287
00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:03.190
If you've got a problem, then bid higher!
I'm buying that thing!

288
00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:05.560
P-Please, calm down, gentlemen!

289
00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:05.560
Oh, you think I can't?!

290
00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:09.060
Everyone's losing their minds
because of the relic's effect.

291
00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:13.210
I can use this to knock the 
other bidders out of the race.

292
00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:18.160
Please don't feel bad.

293
00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:21.850
You might be able to make 
the people around you happy.

294
00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.330
Let's talk about the deal.

295
00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:25.830
Really?

296
00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:31.610
I made it sound like we could 
solve her problem in no time.

297
00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:36.840
And the happier she became,
the stronger the relic grew.

298
00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:39.960
All the participants 
completely lost their minds

299
00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:42.710
and fought over every 
single item at the auction.

300
00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:45.880
Ogawara's dominance must 
have been ridiculously strong,

301
00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:49.850
because he was barely affected 
and won several bids.

302
00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:56.350
Naturally, when he showed interest 
in junk relics, I drove up the bid.

303
00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:04.830
HAMMURABI'S CODE
SHAKESPEARE'S PEN
MARIE ANTOINETTE'S NECKLACE

304
00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:03.480
Let's see... Hammurabi's Code, 
Shakespeare's Pen,

305
00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:06.130
Marie Antoinette's Necklace...

306
00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:09.460
But the God-grade relic from 
the prophecy still hasn't appeared.

307
00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:10.380
What's the deal?

308
00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:16.340
Now, we would like to present to you 
an item unannounced in the catalog.

309
00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:20.780
You may have already seen 
this item in the news:

310
00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.480
a mysterious almond tree sapling!

311
00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:22.520
That's...

312
00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:28.200
That sapling is... the Tree of Life!

